@prefix backlog: <http://example.org/backlog#> .
@prefix ex:      <http://example.org/sen0414-ch18corr-lineage#> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:     <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<http://example.org/sen0414-ch18corr-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Fresh narrow lineage: SEN0414 Chapter 18 corrections"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.5.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch18corr-lineage/1.5.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch18corr_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment "1.5.0 (2026-11-18): Spec and deck stories Done: chapter 18 deck 3.0.0 and manifest 1.1.0 built by the generic builder 2.4.0 from spec_v3_0_0; change request: the material check moves from 1.0.1 to 1.0.2 (a code frame is a shape named code)."@en .

ex:TK9_Spec_Build backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Spec folder 08-tooling/ch18-deck/spec_v3_0_0: examples (those of 2.0.3, with p13_write and p13_read re-cut so that every code box parses on its own; results unchanged), visuals (imports moved to deck kit 2.1.0), content (words of 2.0.3; stories told as four short paragraphs of at most 30 words with the same facts and links; two analogy titles lengthened) and spec.py. The generic builder 2.3.0 hard-coded 'five parts' in the route title, so builder 2.4.0 (08-tooling/chapter_deck_build_v2_4_0.py) writes the number of parts." .
ex:TK9_Spec_Verify backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Builder 2.4.0 run on the spec: 27 examples, 53 slides. Old manifest 1.0.3 against new 1.1.0 (08-tooling/ch18-deck/logs_v3_0_0/examples_compare_old_new.log): same ids in the same order, expected results identical 27 of 27, code identical except p13_write (re-cut). Run by the builder that wrote the spec, with a comparison against the old files; not independent." .
ex:TK9_Deck_Build backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Deck 03-materials/ch18/SEN0414_Ch18_CSVJSONXML_3e_v3_0_0.pptx and manifest chapter_code_ch18_v1_1_0.json. 53 notes written for the rulings (53 of 53 within 60-140 words; each says what to point at, what the result shows and leads into the next slide). CHANGE REQUEST on the declared measure's tool: cme_material_check 1.0.1 took every Courier New box for code, so monospaced result boxes were parsed as Python; version 1.0.2 reads shapes named code when the deck has any. Chapters 19 and 20 give the same 8 of 8 under both versions; the old chapter 18 deck still fails 7 of 8 under 1.0.2." .
ex:TK9_Deck_Verify backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Logs in 08-tooling/ch18-deck/logs_v3_0_0: material check 1.0.2 on the deck 7 of 8 conditions pass and the page conditions are read at the page stage; deck standard 1.1.0 13 of 13; manifest self-check pass; overlap clean; story prose clean; story repeat clean. Contact sheet of 12 slides looked at. Not shown: independent reading of the notes (the review record covers it); links not re-opened." .
ex:ST9_Spec backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Spec built and run; see its tasks." .
ex:ST9_Deck backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Deck 3.0.0 and manifest 1.1.0 built and checked; see its tasks." .

ex:Obs1_Obj9_SpecRuns a backlog:MetricObservation ; backlog:observationForMetric ex:Metric_Obj9_SpecRuns ; backlog:observedValue 1 ; backlog:observedAt "2026-11-18T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ; rdfs:comment "The generic builder 2.4.0 runs spec_v3_0_0 and writes deck 3.0.0."@en .
ex:Obs1_Obj9_DeckStandard a backlog:MetricObservation ; backlog:observationForMetric ex:Metric_Obj9_DeckStandard ; backlog:observedValue 0 ; backlog:observedAt "2026-11-18T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ; rdfs:comment "Deck standard 1.1.0 on deck 3.0.0: 13 of 13 pass (2 failed on 2.0.3)."@en .
ex:Obs1_Obj9_MaterialConditions a backlog:MetricObservation ; backlog:observationForMetric ex:Metric_Obj9_MaterialConditions ; backlog:observedValue 1 ; backlog:observedAt "2026-11-18T00:00:00Z"^^xsd:dateTime ; rdfs:comment "Material check 1.0.2 on deck 3.0.0 with the old page 9.96.2: 7 of 8 pass; the one failing condition is lambda in the page code (322 occurrences), a page task."@en .
